    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d449-a1">

                <pb facs="0616" n="510" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg510"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 245.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr.
                            Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Treasury Department,<lb/>Office of the Secretary</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1891-04-29"><hi rendition="#italic">April 29,
                                1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose herewith a copy
                    of the affidavit of Nikolaus Bader, an alien who, on arrival at the port of New
                    York on the 23d instant on the steamship <hi rendition="#italic">Waesland</hi>
                    from Antwerp, was prohibited from landing by the superintendent of immigration
                    at that port as belonging to the excluded classes, and has been returned by the
                    same vessel to the port from which he came.</p>
                <p>If Bader’s statement be true as set forth in his affidavit, he was sent to this
                    country by the authorities of Stauzach, Germany, with knowledge that he had been
                    convicted and imprisoned for murder and afterwards confined for insanity.</p>
                <p>The case is submitted to you as being one that might properly be brought to the
                    attention of the German authorities.</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles Foster</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
